{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About This Booklet</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This digital art and instruction booklet is a companion to <strong>Toni Island Adventure</strong>, designed in the spirit of classic retro game manuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inside, you'll find:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A full breakdown of the game's controls and mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tips on how to get started on your adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Background on Toni and the island\u2019s quirky characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand-drawn artwork and concept illustrations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just like the manuals from the golden age of handheld gaming, this booklet brings the world of <strong>Toni Island Adventure</strong> to life, with tips, characters, and charm packed into every page.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3787420?t=1749077798","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3787420?t=1749077798","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787420/a179c1f6e70296bdc5977addcd40944be6559383/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749077798","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787420/a179c1f6e70296bdc5977addcd40944be6559383/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749077798","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About This Booklet</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This digital art and instruction booklet is a companion to <strong>Toni Island Adventure</strong>, designed in the spirit of classic retro game manuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inside, you'll find:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\